#: org.kde.krita.appdata.xml:143 org.kde.krita.appdata.xml:172
msgid "A minor bugfix release for the Krita Stable channel"
msgstr "Manje izdanje s ispravcima grešaka za stabilni kanal Krite"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.krita.appdata.xml:201
msgid "This release mainly fixes a slowdown issue for Windows users who use automation tools like Microsoft Windows Powertoys' Fancy Zones or the Google Drive plugin"
msgstr "Ovo izdanje uglavnom ispravlja usporavanje kod korisnika sustava Windows koji koriste alate za automatizaciju kao što su Fancy Zones iz Microsoft PowerToys ili dodatak Google Drive"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.krita.appdata.xml:230
msgid "A new major release featuring the new on-canvas text tool, gap-closing features, selection toolbar and the new knife tool"
msgstr "Novo veliko izdanje donosi novi tekstni alat na platnu, značajke za zatvaranje praznina, alatnu traku odabira i novi alat noža"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.krita.appdata.xml:259
msgid "A bug fix release with a number of crash fixes and workarounds to improve use with the Xiaomi Pad"
msgstr "Izdanje s ispravcima grešaka i brojnim popravcima rušenja te zaobilaznim rješenjima za bolji rad na uređaju Xiaomi Pad"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.krita.appdata.xml:339
msgid "Only a little later than we had planned, this is the next feature release of Krita! With a whole slew of new fill layer types, including the really versatile SeExpr based scriptable fill layer type, exciting new options for Krita’s brushes like the gradient map mode for brushes, lightness and gradient modes for brush textures, support for dynamic use of colors in gradients, webm export for animations, new scripting features — and of course, hundreds of bug fixes that make this version of Krita better than ever. Especially exciting are all the fixes we made for Krita on ChromeOS and Android!"
msgstr "Samo malo kasnije nego što smo planirali, stiže novo funkcionalno izdanje Krite! Donosi cijeli niz novih vrsta slojeva ispune, uključujući vrlo svestranu vrstu skriptabilnog sloja ispune temeljenu na SeExpru, uzbudljive nove mogućnosti za kistove poput načina mapiranja gradijenta, načina svjetline i gradijenta za teksture kista, podršku za dinamičku upotrebu boja u gradijentima, izvoz animacija u WebM, nove mogućnosti skriptiranja — i, naravno, stotine ispravaka grešaka koje ovu inačicu Krite čine boljom no ikad. Posebno su uzbudljivi svi popravci za Kritu na sustavima ChromeOS i Android!"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.krita.appdata.xml:344
msgid "Three months after the release of Krita 4.2.9, we’ve got a major new feature release for you: Krita 4.3.0! We’ve spent the past year not just fixing bugs, even though we fixed over a thousand issues, but have also been busy adding cool new stuff to play with."
msgstr "Tri mjeseca nakon izdanja Krite 4.2.9 donosimo vam novo veliko izdanje s brojnim značajkama: Kritu 4.3.0! Proteklu smo godinu proveli ne samo ispravljajući greške — riješili smo ih više od tisuću — već i dodajući zanimljive nove mogućnosti."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.krita.appdata.xml:345
msgid "There’s a whole new set of brush presets that evoke watercolor painting. There’s a color mode in the gradient map filter and a brand new palletize filter and a high pass filter. The scripting API has been extended. It’s now possible to adjust the opacity and lightness on colored brush tips separately. You can now create animated brush tips that select brush along multiple dimensions. We’ve made it possible to put the canvas area in a window of its own, so on a multi monitor setup, you can have all the controls on one monitor, and your images on the other. The color selector has had a big update. There’s a new snapshot docker that stores states of your image, and you can switch between those. There’s a brand new magnetic selection tool. Gradients can now be painting as spirals."
msgstr "Dostupan je posve novi skup predložaka kistova za akvarelno slikanje. Dodan je način boje u filtru mapiranja gradijenta te potpuno novi filtar posterizacije i filtar visokih frekvencija. Proširen je API za skriptiranje. Sada je moguće zasebno podešavati neprozirnost i svjetlinu obojenih vrhova kista. Možete stvarati animirane vrhove kista koji odabiru kist prema više dimenzija. Područje platna sada se može smjestiti u zaseban prozor pa na sustavu s više monitora možete imati sve kontrole na jednom, a slike na drugom monitoru. Odabirnik boja znatno je unaprijeđen. Novi docker za snimke pohranjuje stanja slike između kojih možete prelaziti. Dodan je potpuno novi alat za magnetski odabir. Gradijenti se sada mogu slikati u obliku spirala."
